        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Animated Weapons"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(divine, evocation)\n\nThe warsworn assumes control of unattended weapons within 100 feet, forcing them to levitate around it. The warsworn can telekinetically wield these weapons to make melee Strikes with a reach of 100 feet."
            },
            "id": "a28a788b-0e0a-4c10-ab1b-e1ddd3af1033",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-23T01:11:48.023497"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Energy Drain"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(divine, necromancy)\n\nWhen a warsworn hits with a corpse wave Strike or damages a creature with Trample, the target must succeed at a 35 Fortitude save or become drained 2 and doomed 1. On a critical success, the target becomes temporarily immune to the warsworn's energy drain for 24 hours."
            },
            "id": "0677c962-05e9-435e-84bc-644805c4c433",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-23T01:11:48.023497"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Plummet"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "A creature hit by a warsworn's scrap ball Strike must attempt a 37 Reflex save. On a failure, the target falls prone; if the target was airborne, it falls up to 120 feet, taking damage from the fall and landing prone if the descent brings it to the ground. On a critical failure, the target is also held under a pile of scrap (37 to Escape)."
            },
            "id": "1c8f81d5-0121-4950-8f62-666acf633d0a",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-23T01:11:48.023497"
            }
          }
        }
